    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/90c6ecd5765e685c9a0fc3eaf9a2ee89.poster.avif?t=1740063229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/90c6ecd5765e685c9a0fc3eaf9a2ee89.webm?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/90c6ecd5765e685c9a0fc3eaf9a2ee89.mp4?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/cec016d34b4e36f02335767d40c3f366.webp?t=1740063229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That\u2019s right folks! After more then 30 years the <strong>Samurai Pizza Cats </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >finally return! <strong>The Big Cheese</strong> has an evil Scheme up his sleeve and it\u2019s up to you, the player to stop him from taking over <strong>Little Tokyo</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/ebf0496bfaffbf5f273bc754f9f0f13c.poster.avif?t=1740063229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/ebf0496bfaffbf5f273bc754f9f0f13c.webm?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/b7ef411943498329b0210ae30a775cc4.avif?t=1740063229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Instantly switch between your favorite cats and utilise each characters <strong>unique abilities</strong> for <strong>puzzle</strong> solving and creative <strong>combat</strong> variations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/da45711612d129972c344cf8fd2ca4de.poster.avif?t=1740063229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/da45711612d129972c344cf8fd2ca4de.webm?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/da45711612d129972c344cf8fd2ca4de.mp4?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/77d0dfaad232522002575232e7e5b51b.avif?t=1740063229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush your enemies with special attacks in <strong>classic 90s anime</strong> fashion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/499184aa2952ef1744d78db7ed4296db.poster.avif?t=1740063229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/499184aa2952ef1744d78db7ed4296db.webm?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/0f795cbaf49946c881e28844cc458a32.avif?t=1740063229\" /></span>Explore the adventurous overworld of Little Tokyo where you battle fierce enemies to level up your characters and obtain special cards which can be equipped to expand your combat abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/58a2f7c08235692df41fc580e9d50546.poster.avif?t=1740063229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/58a2f7c08235692df41fc580e9d50546.webm?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/58a2f7c08235692df41fc580e9d50546.mp4?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
