ch between your favorite cats and utilise each characters <strong>unique abilities</strong> for <strong>puzzle</strong> solving and creative <strong>combat</strong> variations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/da45711612d129972c344cf8fd2ca4de.poster.avif?t=1740063229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/da45711612d129972c344cf8fd2ca4de.webm?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/da45711612d129972c344cf8fd2ca4de.mp4?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/77d0dfaad232522002575232e7e5b51b.avif?t=1740063229\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush your enemies with special attacks in <strong>classic 90s anime</strong> fashion!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/499184aa2952ef1744d78db7ed4296db.poster.avif?t=1740063229\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/499184aa2952ef1744d78db7ed4296db.webm?t=1740063229\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2413800/extras/0f795cbaf49946c881e28844cc458a32.avif?t=1740063229\" /></span>Explore the adventurous overworld of 